1. Indian domestic air-traffic data (DGCA)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files:   backend/dgca_data/city_traffic.csv
         backend/route_weights.csv (derived from the file above by
         backend/calculate_dgca_weights.py)
Source:  india-aviation-traffic by Vonter — https://github.com/Vonter/india-aviation-traffic
         Original data: Directorate General of Civil Aviation (DGCA),
         https://www.dgca.gov.in/digigov-portal/ and Ministry of Civil Aviation,
         https://www.civilaviation.gov.in/
License: Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0 —
         https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/

Contains information from the india-aviation-traffic dataset, which is made
available under the ODbL. The two files above (including the derived route
weights) are shared under the same license, not under MIT.

