2. Fonts
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The dashboard loads Barlow, Barlow Condensed and IBM Plex Mono through
next/font/google. The font files are not stored in this repository; they are
downloaded at build time and are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Data and affiliation
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Fare observations in this repository are synthetic, or were collected from the
bundled mock booking site (scraper/mock_site/). No live airline or OTA pages
were scraped. Airline and OTA names are trademarks of their owners and are used
only to describe the problem.

This project was built for Smart India Hackathon 2026 (SIH26056) and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by MoSPI, DGCA, the Ministry of Civil Aviation or
any airline.
